<h3>General Notes</h3>

<ul>

    <li>If someone has a darker skintone, <strong>do not whitewash them</strong>.</li>
    <li>Also do not make them skinnier than they are, remove mobility aids/disabilities/scars, or make them conventionally attractive.</li>
    <li>Different outfits are fine and you can come up with your own, if you'd like.</li>
    <li>Don't make muscular characters skinny either.</li>

</ul>